  "which_better": {
    "title": "Multi-Point Suspension Crane Case Studies",
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Multi-Point Suspension Crane for Aircraft Maintenance Workshop",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In an aircraft maintenance workshop, a multi-point suspension crane is used for lifting, transporting, and positioning large aircraft components such as fuselage sections, wings, tail assemblies, engines, and landing gear.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Due to the large size, complex shapes, and extremely high requirements for balance, synchronization, and precise positioning during lifting, this crane uses multiple support points to distribute the load and achieve synchronized lifting/moving.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This enables it to smoothly and precisely move large, irregularly shaped components from one workstation to another, and lift engines, wings, and other parts onto maintenance platforms while minimizing component sway.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For aircraft hangars with large spans and spacious interiors, overhead cranes can fully utilize the upper space without occupying floor area, thereby improving space utilization and maintenance efficiency.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Multi-Point Suspension Crane for a Large Rubber Manufacturing Plant",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This project was implemented in a large-span rubber production workshop.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The building was an existing structure with complex structural conditions, and some steel components had deformation.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In addition, the production process required lifting and transporting extra-long materials, imposing high demands on load balance and operational stability of the lifting equipment.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Given this, the project adopted a multi-point suspension crane solution to accommodate the large-span structure and enhance overall operational safety.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The project is equipped with two multi-point suspension cranes, each featuring a 60-meter Main Girder and a seven-point suspension design to effectively distribute the load.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Additionally, specialized lifting devices for handling extra-long materials were provided to meet specific material handling needs during production.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To address adverse installation conditions such as deformation of existing steel structures, a comprehensive on-site assessment was conducted before installation.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Subsequently, corrective measures were taken on the supporting steel structure to ensure reliable installation and long-term stable operation of the crane.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "span",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "i18n-pending"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
